  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Capacities of Key Stakeholders and Communities to Prevent Trafficking in Persons in Illegal Mining Areas in Brazil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the capacities of key stakeholders and raise awareness among target communities in the Amazon Region in Brazil about TiP issues and risks in the context of illegal mining, in particular traditional and indigenous communities, with a special focus on the sexual exploitation of women and girls.</narrative>
  </description>
